@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
### Create an order; repeat with the same reference and payload for an idempotent response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientReference": "web-checkout-2027-0001",
  "customerEmail": "alex@example.ie",
  "amount": 129.95,
  "currency": "EUR"
}
### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?page=0&size=20
